<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Dictionary Key="af403322-0cc5-4f52-89a6-373210d64dd2" Alias="Health.Consent.Purpose" Level="1">
  <Info>
    <Parent>Health</Parent>
  </Info>
  <Translations>
    <Translation Language="en-US">To book your appointment and provide care we need to process data about your health: the reason for the visit, your appointments and what the professionals who see you record. This is sensitive data. Giving it is optional and you are not required to authorize it; without this authorization, though, we cannot book your appointment online.</Translation>
    <Translation Language="es-CO">Para agendar tu cita y prestarte la atención necesitamos tratar datos sobre tu salud: el motivo de la consulta, tus citas y lo que registren los profesionales que te atiendan. Son datos sensibles. Darlos es facultativo y no estás obligado a autorizarlo; sin esta autorización, eso sí, no podemos agendar tu cita en línea.</Translation>
  </Translations>
</Dictionary>
